hpc:JobDescription a owl:Class .

hpc:deadline a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:JobDescription ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:distributionPlaneSize a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:JobDescription ;
    rdfs:range xsd:int16 .

hpc:endTime a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:JobDescription ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:excludedNodes a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:JobDescription ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:flags a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:JobDescription ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:flags a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf owl:unionOf ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:JobDescription .

hpc:flags KILL_INVALID_DEPENDENCY a owl:EnumeratedClass ;
    rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:flags ;
    owl:someValuesFrom xsd:string ;
    owl:enumeration "KILL_INVALID_DEPENDENCY" .

hpc:flags NO_KILL_INVALID_DEPENDENCY a owl:EnumeratedClass ;
    rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:flags ;
    owl:someValuesFrom xsd:string ;
    owl:enumeration "NO_KILL_INVALID_DEPENDENCY" .

... (Repeat the above pattern for the remaining flags)
```

This Turtle code defines a class `hpc:JobDescription` and several datatype and object properties related to it. The `hpc:flags` property is defined as an object property that is a union of the enumerated classes representing the different flag values. Each flag value is defined as an `owl:EnumeratedClass` with the appropriate `owl:enumeration` statement.
